WEBVTT

00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:30.498
Step outside of your shoes
that you're in right now,

00:12:30.522 --> 00:12:32.312
and step back into your normal shoes.

00:12:32.336 --> 00:12:34.311
So everyone's back in the room. OK?

00:12:35.265 --> 00:12:37.166
Now here comes the radical experiment.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.547
So we're all back home.

00:12:39.216 --> 00:12:41.308
This photo: this woman --

00:12:41.332 --> 00:12:43.205
man, I feel her.

00:12:43.229 --> 00:12:44.802
I feel her.

00:12:44.826 --> 00:12:46.306
She's my sister,

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.514
my wife, my cousin, my neighbor.

00:12:49.538 --> 00:12:50.934
She's anybody to me.

00:12:50.958 --> 00:12:53.665
These guys standing there,
everybody in the photo --

00:12:53.689 --> 00:12:55.406
I feel this photo, man.

00:12:56.832 --> 00:12:58.467
So here's what I want you to do.

00:12:58.491 --> 00:13:01.543
Let's go back to my first
example, of the Chinese.